{
  "title": "Maui 2010 - 4th of July",
  "slug": "maui-2010-4th-of-july",
  "date": "2010-07-04",
  "section": "travel",
  "summary": "Of course the 4th of July has always been a great time to go find some awesome fireworks shows, but I have to say there is something special about watching a show while sitting on a Hawaiian beach with the waves of the Pacific crashing right at your feet!",
  "body": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Of course the 4th of July has always been a great time to go find some awesome fireworks shows, but I have to say there is something special about watching a show while sitting on a Hawaiian beach with the waves of the Pacific crashing right at your feet!",
      "links": []
    }
